  "title": {
   "en": "Even the Lottery Jackpot Winner Still Goes to Work"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "로또 1등도 출근합니다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Gong Eun-tae, an ordinary sales employee you can find anywhere,\nwins the jackpot in the lottery—something he had only dreamed of!\n\nAfter taxes, he takes home 1.8 billion won.\nA large sum, but is it really enough to turn his life upside down?\n\"Let’s just live as I always have… I'll think of the lottery as insurance for my peace of mind.\"\n\nWith that reassuring safety net, he takes the leap—\nand suddenly, everything he does starts going unbelievably well?!\n\nToday, Eun-tae heads to work once again!\nBut this time, with a whole new mindset."
  },
